Exactly. If your goal is eventually to sell forecasting as a service, you should learn it end-to-end, not just learn Prophet/XGBoost and call yourself a forecaster.

I’d structure your learning as a “Time-Series Forecasting from Zero → Production → Client Delivery” path.

The full roadmap

